%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a4fafe43b89343e3a7ba1235e8987c0f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 2 SoldierResults
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Entries:
  - content: 'Hey, you''re Jackie right? '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d5a65a5aa8d5f964fbd28b4f0ae8ecaf, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3264111934402461768
    - rid: 3264111934402461770
    - rid: 3264111934402461769
    - rid: 3264111934402461767
  - content: 'Yeah, that''s me. Do I know you? '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 3264111934402461772
    - rid: 3264111934402461775
    - rid: 3264111934402461771
    - rid: 3264111934402461774
  - content: Nah, I'm just a fan. Heard rumours about what you did during the exam.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d5a65a5aa8d5f964fbd28b4f0ae8ecaf, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Ah that...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events:
    - rid: 1207053096974024766
  - content: To be honest, I wish that didn't happen. It took so much time away from
      my actual exam.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: ...
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d5a65a5aa8d5f964fbd28b4f0ae8ecaf, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'You nervous about the results? '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d5a65a5aa8d5f964fbd28b4f0ae8ecaf, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'Yeah... I really need to pass. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'There''s someone that needs me to. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: I don't suppose they can wait?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d5a65a5aa8d5f964fbd28b4f0ae8ecaf, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'They''ve already waited a year. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'I see. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d5a65a5aa8d5f964fbd28b4f0ae8ecaf, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'I wish you the best of luck then. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d5a65a5aa8d5f964fbd28b4f0ae8ecaf, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: <i>CHZHCKK
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Good morning citizens of New Haven City.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: 'Today we honour the courage and valor of those who took the NTIES exam. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: In addition to the usual Waste Products, a very special discovery was
      made during the exam this year!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: A newfound Waste power source five times more efficient than what we
      synthesize today!
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: This great achievement means a safer city! Celebrate these heroes you
      get the chance.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
  - content: Nevertheless, this broadcast will announce the score of the NITES exam
      candidates in energy units collected, and whether they passed.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 474297f421f8c524e85a2e1640557075, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 0}
    events: []
